OL,3,A'Fast, furious and dangerous' - a
OL,4,Acity's quad bike menace
OL,5,
OL,6,FSitting in his Birmingham city centre
OL,7,Fapartment, one resident says he can
OL,8,Foften hear them before he sees them.
OL,10,FThe sound of revving engines is
OL,11,Ffollowed by groups of quad bikes and
OL,12,Foff-road motorcycles weaving through
OL,13,Ftraffic, performing wheelies and riding
OL,14,Fthrough some of the busiest streets in
OL,15,Fthe city.
OL,17,F"It's only a matter of time until
OL,18,Fsomething serious happens," he said.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
